  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "接住关心",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "长辈替孩子添衣，先肯定她的细心，再按天气调整。"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sourceIndex": 1,
      "alt": "家人一起照顾孩子，先接住关心再调整做法",
      "path": "E:\\JIMMY\\github\\blog-rebuild\\.recreate-work\\0911-article-K1BG2mY\\cards\\image-001.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "守住边界",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "消费观不同，不必当场争输赢；安排好自己的选择，换个轻松说法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sourceIndex": 3,
      "alt": "家人讨论家庭开支，在分歧中保留体面",
      "path": "E:\\JIMMY\\github\\blog-rebuild\\.recreate-work\\0911-article-K1BG2mY\\cards\\image-002.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "顺势而为",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "嘴上接住情绪，行动保留主见。让对方安心，也让自己自在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sourceIndex": 5,
      "alt": "陪伴父母并及时联系，让关心落在当下",
      "path": "E:\\JIMMY\\github\\blog-rebuild\\.recreate-work\\0911-article-K1BG2mY\\cards\\image-003.png"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "家人相处，少一点硬碰硬，多一点留台阶。"
}
